  "term": "testosterone",
  "definition": "Testosterone is a gonadal hormone that can be measured in saliva and studied in relation to behavior. In this packet, it is described as showing a context-dependent association with a regulatory aspect of impulsivity, being linked with perseverance when anxiety levels are higher.",
